{% comment %}
  Calder Wheels — Wheel Catalog for Fitment Matching
  Source of truth for which wheel designs fit which vehicles.
  Rendered on-demand by async-fitment-results.liquid.

  For launch, this mirrors the curated fitment manifest
  (fitment/fitment_manifest.py) and the sizing per Shopify product.
  Fields per handle:
    - bolt_patterns:  bolt patterns the wheel is produced in
    - min/max diameter & width: available sizes on the product
    - offset: typical offsets produced
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign wheel_catalog = '[]'
-%}

